@crew vance
// Head writer 4: career lines. Vance knows the regulations; eleven, section two, is leave.
== career.worried
? tier>=acquaintance flag:career.missed
- There's a regulation about reporting for duty. It's very short. Read it twice.
? tier>=acquaintance flag:career.up
- Good. Back on time. Regulations work best when people turn up for them.
== career.leave
? flag:leave.booked
- Leave booked properly, the evening before. Exactly right. Rare, too.
